  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Police coop. SNPB-LNP</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Polissamarbete RPS-LNP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samarbetet mellan den svenska och liberianska polisen syftar till att st&#xe4;rka den liberianska kapaciteten inom omr&#xe5;det kriminalteknik.       Samarbetet inkluderar tre omr&#xe5;den: 1) Utveckling av Standard          Operating Procedures 2) Utbildning 3) Utrustning</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The cooperation between the Swedish and Liberian police authorities   aims at strengthening the Liberian capacity in the area of forensics. The project focuses on three types of intervention: 1) Standard       operating Procedures 2) Training 3) Equipment</narrative>
  </description>
